      "writtenOn": "2021-09-22T17:17:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see a comment from Jin to this extent. In general, that this is CommonAttributes and an interface{} seems more like an implementation detail, and eventually in bp2build will cast is to a list of interface.\n\nI\u0027d lean toward the return type here being []interface{} but if you can share Jin\u0027s feedback that\u0027d help me understand why we may want a different return.",
